{"branch":"동소문점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">동소문점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-5120fb45fa04762e.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"동소문점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-5120fb45fa04762e.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>서울 성북구 아리랑로7길 5 4층</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 4호선</span><span>성신여대입구역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">우이신설</span><span>성신여대입구역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">우이신설</span><span>정릉역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>정덕초교입구.이수아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>돈암2동주민센터입구.흥천사</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>이수아파트.한신휴아파트입구</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>돈암힐스테이트.코오롱하늘채</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>돈암지구대.현대아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>돈암지구대.현대아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>돈암힐스테이트.코오롱하늘채</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>돈암2동주민센터입구.흥천사</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>돈암신일해피트리아파트</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>성북22</span><span>성북20</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">간선</span></dt><dd><span>162</span><span>N31(심야)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span